{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qGuOFombzw1795216735.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美元匯價連升8日後回軟，收市微跌。</p><p></p><p>反映美元兌六隻主要貨幣的美匯指數，收市報103.84，跌百分之0.05。全個星期計，則升百分之0.4。今個月以來，更錄得百分之1.9升幅。</p><p></p><p>美國聯儲局加息預期升溫，推動美元匯價月內上升，但美股急挫，加上美國10年期債息回軟，就令美元匯價單日下跌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T00:23:49.751085+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T23:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T02:57:22.310180+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T00:17:14.245464+00:00","content_hash":"1561c5b5fdc92382576b1d420135d68d1e4d4193e00da41de68469b0637d3058","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}